"de oración."

#. translators: to prevent spamming, navigate to the Google reCAPTCHA website and sign up for an API key.
#: src/Admin/admin-settings.php:286
msgid ""
"To prevent spam on the email access form navigate to %1$sthe Google "
"reCAPTCHA website%2$s and sign up for an API key. The reCAPTCHA uses "
"Google's user-friendly single click verification method."
msgstr ""
"Para evitar el spam en el formulario de acceso al correo electrónico, "
"navegue hasta% 1 $ stel sitio web de Google reCAPTCHA% 2 $ s y regístrese "
"para obtener una clave API. El reCAPTCHA utiliza el método de verificación "
"de un solo clic fácil de usar de Google."

#: src/Admin/admin-settings.php:293
msgid "reCAPTCHA Site Key"
